{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Elidriel</strong></i> is a story-driven JRPG inspired by the SNEs and Playstation 2D classics with a modernize twist in the battle system and tons of ways to explore all lands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight bosses that you will need to combine your power with <i><strong>Synergy</strong></i> techniques</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437550/extras/abb5a82350f27aa89b5718a367dc20ec.poster.avif?t=1771292742\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437550/extras/abb5a82350f27aa89b5718a367dc20ec.webm?t=1771292742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437550/extras/abb5a82350f27aa89b5718a367dc20ec.mp4?t=1771292742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Battle... But yea, you can parry!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437550/extras/37622a677d5ba6e319095347738eb1c0.poster.avif?t=1771292742\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437550/extras/37622a677d5ba6e319095347738eb1c0.webm?t=1771292742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437550/extras/37622a677d5ba6e319095347738eb1c0.mp4?t=1771292742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore All Types of Landscapes with unique traversal system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437550/extras/0b8c2c135cbcf